            "type": "text",
            "text": "Press Play below to start the backing track: a drone on A for eight bars, four in A Dorian, then four in A Mixolydian. Play each scale up and back down along with the neck, and listen for the bar where the 3rd moves.\nThe faded note is the one to leave out: C♯ in the first half, C in the second."
