            "type": "text",
            "text": "The same frets in A Mixolydian: the 3rd has moved up a fret, to {{3}}. Play the phrases you just made up again and end them on the new 3rd.\nThen slide into it from one fret below. {{c}} is not in A Mixolydian: it is the minor 3rd you just left, and blues players slide from it up to {{3}} all the time."
